// ESXi Syslog Configuration Change Via ESXCLI | T1059.012, T1685, T1690 | https://github.com/SigmaHQ/sigma/blob/master/rules/linux/process_creation/proc_creation_lnx_esxcli_syslog_config_change.yml
DeviceProcessEvents
| where FolderPath endswith "/esxcli" and (ProcessCommandLine contains "system" and ProcessCommandLine contains "syslog" and ProcessCommandLine contains "config") and ProcessCommandLine contains " set"
